        "code": "IList<string> strList1 = new List<string>() { \"One\", \"Two\", \"Three\", \"Four\", \"Five\" };\nIList<string> strList2 = new List<string>() { \"Four\", \"Five\", \"Six\", \"Seven\", \"Eight\" };\n\nvar result = strList1.Except(strList2);\n\n// Result: \"One\", \"Two\", \"Three\""
      }
