        "content": "Counting elements in collections",
        "language": "csharp",
        "code": "IList<int> intList = new List<int>() { 10, 21, 30, 45, 50 };\n\nvar totalElements = intList.Count();\n// Result: 5\n\nvar evenElements = intList.Count(i => i % 2 == 0);\n// Result: 3"
