    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "First Operator"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "The `First` method returns the first element of a collection. If the collection is empty or no element satisfies the condition, it throws an `InvalidOperationException`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "data": {
        "title": "First Examples",
        "content": "Retrieving the first element",
        "language": "csharp",
        "code": "IList<int> intList = new List<int>() { 7, 10, 21, 30, 45, 50, 87 };\n\nConsole.WriteLine(intList.First());                    // 7\nConsole.WriteLine(intList.First(i => i % 2 == 0));    // 10 (first even)\n\n// emptyList.First() throws InvalidOperationException"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "data": {
        "level": 2,
        "text": "FirstOrDefault Operator"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "The `FirstOrDefault` method returns the first element, or the default value if the collection is empty or no element satisfies the condition."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "data": {
        "title": "FirstOrDefault Examples",
        "content": "Retrieving the first element safely",
        "language": "csharp",
        "code": "IList<int> intList = new List<int>() { 7, 10, 21, 30, 45, 50, 87 };\nIList<string> emptyList = new List<string>();\n\nConsole.WriteLine(intList.FirstOrDefault());                    // 7\nConsole.WriteLine(intList.FirstOrDefault(i => i % 2 == 0));    // 10\nConsole.WriteLine(emptyList.FirstOrDefault());                  // null (default string)"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "data": {
        "variant": "warning",
        "title": "Null Elements",
        "text": "Be careful with null elements. FirstOrDefault may throw an exception when evaluating a condition on a null element."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "summary-box",
      "data": {
        "title": "Key Takeaways",
        "points": [
